### Important note about the binary format

The application writes each record in this exact order:

```csharp
binaryOut.Write(student.StudentID);   // int
binaryOut.Write(student.Name);        // string
binaryOut.Write(student.GPA);         // decimal
```

Therefore, it must read the fields in the same order:

```csharp
StudentID = binaryIn.ReadInt32(),
Name = binaryIn.ReadString(),
GPA = binaryIn.ReadDecimal()
```

If the write order and read order do not match, the binary file will appear corrupted.

