On older Spring Boot 2.x versions, you may see configuration using multiple `WebSecurityConfigurerAdapter` classes with `@Order` and `http.requestMatcher(...)`. On modern Spring Security 6 / Spring Boot 3, prefer multiple `SecurityFilterChain` beans and `http.securityMatcher(...)`.

