A good way to do this in Textual is to avoid a literal `Button` inside another `Button`, because nested interactive buttons are usually not the intended Textual pattern. Instead, make the outer file row behave like a button: make it focusable/clickable and style it like a button, then put a real `Delete` button inside it.

