yield Button("Delete", id="delete-btn")
```

In Textual, IDs should be unique. Repeating `id="file-btn"` and `id="delete-btn"` for every row is fragile and can cause problems, especially with queries or CSS selectors. A better approach is to use classes or unique IDs.

