```csharp
var original = new HashSet<string>
{
    "apple",
    "banana",
    "cherry"
};

byte[] bytes = HashSetStringBytes.Marshal(original);

HashSet<string> restored = HashSetStringBytes.Unmarshal(bytes);
```

