Below is a complete, self-contained 2D platformer that runs in a browser. It includes movement, jumping, attacking, a grappling hook, enemies, loot, and a level goal.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Hook Platformer</title>
<style>
  body { margin:0; background:#0b1020; color:#fff; font-family:sans-serif; display:grid; place-items:center; min-height:100vh; }
